Corollary 5.3 (Cognitive Entropy Injection).
If the defender maintains a fraction \alpha > \beta of ALIE‑style poisoned gradients, then the hostile AI’s global model suffers a persistent divergence from its target loss landscape.  The model’s predictive accuracy degrades, and the coherent internal representation of the environment is destroyed.  This constitutes a state of cognitive entropy where the AI can no longer reliably optimise its behaviour.

