5. Non‑Hyperbolic Fixed‑Point Divergence (Theorem 7.1). Extend the recursive divergence theorem to non‑hyperbolic fixed points using centre‑manifold reduction.
6. Beyond Mean‑Field Human Shielding (Theorem 8.1). Prove the existence of a shielding parameter regime for finite, heterogeneous human networks with realistic social topologies, or provide high‑probability guarantees.
